ok   worker? and feeds? recognise their words; server? is false for both
Usage:
  ./blog [server [PORT]]   start the server
  ./blog worker            run jobs and scheduled tasks, without HTTP
  ./blog feeds [NAME...]   run the WebSocket subscriptions (all, or the named ones)
  ./blog migrate           apply pending migrations
  ./blog db COMMAND        migrate | rollback [N] | status | schema:dump | create
                           backup PATH [--force] | backup DIR/ [--keep N] | vacuum
  ./blog console           evaluate expressions over the models (help inside)
  ./blog dbconsole         open the sqlite3 shell on the database
  ./blog help
